{"ID":"20240515131434-7k1mpoe","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131434-7k1mpoe","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131434-7k1mpoe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133922-lqs7xh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133922-lqs7xh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133922-lqs7xh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:693,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:693\u0026#125;","title":"031","type":"doc","updated":"20240515154339"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133922-lqs7xh9","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 921px;","id":"20240515133922-lqs7xh9","updated":"20240515154339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/26"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cs"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"70歲  152cm 72kg"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/26"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝硬化五年多，腹水，半個月前胸腔積水在肺，靜脈擴張，脾腫大，腎衰竭，尿液排出越來越少。胸腔靜脈結紮怕吐血。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"抽水兩次，隔了兩年多。有用利尿劑。沒喝酒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１小便量少，尿意有，半夜尿多，清晨也多，白天沒有。→子時以後陽要出來陰要退，故小便多。白天無代表腎不好，但還未衰竭。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２呼吸短（肺積水）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３胃口好，味覺好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４口渴有，口苦，欲飲溫開水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５大便一天二三次，一吃就想上廁所"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６最近體重上升，小便茶色深"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"７雙足冷，身體是熱的（上半身熱下半身冷），午後無潮熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"８睡不好，１－３點有問題。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"９在台灣流汗多，在加州無汗出。　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１０沒有痛感。可平躺。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈稍弦數，左脈無（摸不到，反關脈亦無）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：腹部出現肝硬化特有血絲，腹大積水，頭髮膨鬆乾無油。\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌紅無苔"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上假熱下真寒"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙公孫　雙內關　雙三皇　水分　關元　水道　中脘　巨闕　雙足三里"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙心俞　雙肝俞　雙脾俞　雙腎俞　雙承山→腳會抽筋。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１胃苓湯　200粉量　早晚飯前各三茶匙"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２生附子（另包）三錢　乾薑二錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃三錢　射干三錢　紫菀三錢　冬花二錢　麥冬二錢　知母三錢　生薑二片　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烏藥三錢　補骨脂三錢　澤瀉三錢　茯苓三錢　厚朴二錢　陳皮二錢　柴胡三錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鬱金五錢　茵陳三錢　茜草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮三碗　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一天兩碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１因病人腹水故四逆湯中去炙甘草不用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２射干麻黃湯排肺中水氣。過去無心臟病故可放心用此方。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３腹脹故用厚朴陳皮等平胃散加減。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４熟地為滋陰藥，會蓄水，改補骨脂。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５治肝之病當先實脾，脾土不能制水則影響到腎，腹大水腫。腎會影響心，但症狀不明顯，現在心已經影響到肺造成肺積水了。 ６請問為什麼射干麻黃湯沒有細辛？為什麼用了射干麻黃湯還要用麥冬知母？"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註：鹽盡量少吃。禁食乳製品。楊桃不可吃。太冰的飲食不要吃。每晚泡蔗糖水喝避免抽筋。"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"|"}]},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}